{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Currencies\">Currencies</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Business Currencies On Settings To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The <strong>Currencies</strong> screen, found under the <strong>Settings</strong> tab, allows you to manage and configure the currencies used in your business transactions.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add And BaseCurrency Business Businesses Currencies Currency ForeignCurrencies Is On Sent To ToDate\">This feature is essential for businesses involved in international activities, enabling you to establish a <em>base currency</em> and add multiple <em>foreign currencies</em> as needed.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Currencies On Options To ToDate\">The <strong>Currencies</strong> screen provides access to the following configuration options:</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-coin\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Currencies\">Currencies</span></span></div></div></div><ul><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Currencies ForeignCurrencies Guides\"><a href=\"guides/foreign-currencies\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ForeignCurrencies\">Foreign Currencies</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"ExchangeRate ExchangeRates Guides Rate\"><a href=\"guides/exchange-rates\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ExchangeRates\">Exchange Rates</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"BaseCurrency Currency Guides\"><a href=\"guides/base-currency-form\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BaseCurrency\">Base Currency</span></a></li></ul>",
